         <documentation id="sid-de4a3128-eb59-4195-b746-6cb7abf85d49">One independent instance per postal repair request, identified by CRN and the work-order/line references. The subsequent email is matched within this request instance. The two daily timer starts initiate separate review and closing instances.</documentation>
