      <task completionQuantity="1" id="FFR_f81cb8ec008e5f60ac9d3c7fb17b606c" isForCompensation="false" name="Note CRN on paper notepad" startQuantity="1">
         <documentation id="sid-ef04f8b4-b4f9-4e34-8475-9b3dbeac8308">After dispatch, IM writes the request CRN on a paper notepad as the daily completeness check (60 seconds). Case p.4.</documentation>
