         <task completionQuantity="1" id="FFR_903c3985ecf85a72a73d074719bd4ea1" isForCompensation="false" name="Repair component" startQuantity="1">
            <documentation id="sid-3ed870ac-f182-4661-b3fd-e4544328850b">The technician repairs the diagnosed component (15 minutes) and records the solution/update against its database request. Case pp.4 and 6.</documentation>
            <incoming>FFR_1c163d7cec9c5667be7316c109929bbe</incoming>
            <outgoing>FFR_b4d617a2dcac51cc99392c7225e3f195</outgoing>
         </task>
         <task completionQuantity="1" id="FFR_31ea97cac48456dab01bd89b40cddeee" isForCompensation="false" name="Identify cause of failure" startQuantity="1">
            <documentation id="sid-d43990f6-b4f1-462b-9acb-cf800ed5cf44">Technician: Identify cause of failure. Case p.4.</documentation>
            <incoming>FFR_40c342da0da35d6d8b303bdee5000099</incoming>
            <outgoing>FFR_1c163d7cec9c5667be7316c109929bbe</outgoing>
         </task>
         <task completionQuantity="1" id="FFR_3e3441cda3ca5840a656bb31cfc0e15d" isForCompensation="false" name="Prioritise repair and perform component tests" startQuantity="1">
            <documentation id="sid-bcc8dd03-77a0-496d-a9c9-006c6dc8eeb5">The technician prioritises the assigned repair to return it as soon as possible, considering the latest recorded requirements, then performs component tests (10 minutes). Urgent changes recorded and discussed by IM update the priority/requirements of open or carried-forward work. Case pp.4-5.</documentation>
            <incoming>FFR_b10ad87fa2535eed927d11da88d69b00</incoming>
            <outgoing>FFR_40c342da0da35d6d8b303bdee5000099</outgoing>
         </task>
         <exclusiveGateway gatewayDirection="Diverging" id="FFR_7cca907496ca5afd80e67772d08c4215" name="Test passed?">
            <documentation id="sid-9cbdc13a-5233-4fa7-969e-bde08890cbc5">Technician rig test: pass versus fail; the case gives 40% failure for this test. A fail escalates once to the senior. Case p.4.</documentation>
            <extensionElements>
               <signavio:signavioLabel align="left" bold="" fill="" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="12.0" italic="" ref="text_name" valign="top" x="-35.0" y="-70.0"/>
            </extensionElements>
            <incoming>FFR_b2789ca6fc1459e1b50bfe2c2d2bb09b</incoming>
