         <task completionQuantity="1" id="FFR_949a5c757096501e8074597f7fd05389" isForCompensation="false" name="Repair component" startQuantity="1">
            <documentation id="sid-42ada1c2-b0d1-4d71-a610-54fcbb837e0d">Under the documented senior-repeat assumption, the senior repairs the diagnosed component (15 minutes), may adjust its priority, and records the solution/update against its database request before rig testing. Case pp.4 and 6.</documentation>
            <incoming>FFR_51958ddc5cf9503d9d2a7fca11774e49</incoming>
            <outgoing>FFR_25d86b82d523514e8587c00938da22b3</outgoing>
