      <intermediateCatchEvent id="FFR_9f563aca99585d79aade525c98b20ffb" name="Applicable 3pm dispatch slot">
         <documentation id="sid-479e895d-6b49-4140-aa0b-720be44f50f4">Wait for the assigned working-part dispatch slot. Assumption: ready by 3pm uses that working day; later-ready work carries to the next working-day slot. Becoming ready alone is not dispatch or finalisation.</documentation>
